{"3760200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cubex", "steam_appid": 3760200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/extras/c4d5b11d26dd6aec924a9963e7e8414d.avif?t=1787175897\" width=773 height=125 /></span>You wake up in a strange room, you remember nothing but a counter above your head tells you that you must hurry. Four doors, four challenges, which will you choose? Where will it take you? Will you manage to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT CUBEX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubex is a first-person cooperative (or not) horror escape room game for up to 4 players, where your goal is to find the exit of a giant cube made up of cube-shaped rooms before your teammates do, and especially before the ghost finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CUBE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room has a maximum of 4 possible exits, and each exit represents a puzzle to solve. Logical tests, skill challenges, memory tasks... that will push your mind to the limit as you race against the clock to escape the cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a player solves a puzzle, they will rotate the cube, bringing you closer to the exit or to your end, as Tomino's ghost is free and looking for its next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUND IS VERY IMPORTANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve your tests in the utmost silence possible since Tomino will advance each rotation towards the nearest noisy place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means you cannot scream, you cannot speak too loudly with your teammates (even if they are in the next room), and you must be quick in solving the tests because if you do not do it in the correct time, the alarms will sound.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/extras/c4d5b11d26dd6aec924a9963e7e8414d.avif?t=1787175897\" width=773 height=125 /></span>You wake up in a strange room, you remember nothing but a counter above your head tells you that you must hurry. Four doors, four challenges, which will you choose? Where will it take you? Will you manage to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT CUBEX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubex is a first-person cooperative (or not) horror escape room game for up to 4 players, where your goal is to find the exit of a giant cube made up of cube-shaped rooms before your teammates do, and especially before the ghost finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CUBE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room has a maximum of 4 possible exits, and each exit represents a puzzle to solve. Logical tests, skill challenges, memory tasks... that will push your mind to the limit as you race against the clock to escape the cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a player solves a puzzle, they will rotate the cube, bringing you closer to the exit or to your end, as Tomino's ghost is free and looking for its next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUND IS VERY IMPORTANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve your tests in the utmost silence possible since Tomino will advance each rotation towards the nearest noisy place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This means you cannot scream, you cannot speak too loudly with your teammates (even if they are in the next room), and you must be quick in solving the tests because if you do not do it in the correct time, the alarms will sound.</p>", "short_description": "Cubex is a horror escape room game in first person, collaborative (or not) for up to 4 players, where your objective will be to find the exit of a giant cube.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/f80b43d066cc25ffc99c77641ba7c57621e996a4/header.jpg?t=1787175897", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/7814fbab77f0e21711c69278db6dbebc7e9e3a65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787175897", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/7814fbab77f0e21711c69278db6dbebc7e9e3a65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787175897", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["GAMEZ-STUDIO"], "publishers": ["GAMEZ-STUDIO"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/cdb856774da95eaa49ecdcaccfc80576a54eb93b/ss_cdb856774da95eaa49ecdcaccfc80576a54eb93b.600x338.jpg?t=1787175897", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760200/cdb856774da95eaa49ecdcaccfc80576a54eb93b/ss_cdb856774da95eaa49ecdcaccfc80576a